WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.760
What if an AI agent collected your portfolio,
negotiating like a person

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.260
around the clock?

3
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.260
This is MV Kobra AI.

4
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.700
Kobra analyses your portfolio and predicts who will pay,
so you work first on what

5
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.700
recovers the most.

6
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.340
The negotiating agent sets the strategy, the right discount
and the script for each debtor.

7
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:20.420
The AI agent calls on the phone
and negotiates with a natural voice.

8
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.420
Listen.

9
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:26.380
I can offer you 5,700 today to settle the 6,000,
or split it into 3 instalments.

10
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.900
Doesn't want to talk on the phone?

11
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.920
The same agent negotiates over WhatsApp
and logs everything on its own.

12
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.420
Prefer human agents?

13
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.620
Kobra assists them live.

14
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.020
It reads the customer's mood and suggests what to say.

15
00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.020
It respects calling hours,

16
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.820
the do-not-contact list and the caps.

17
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.300
And every decision is transparent and explainable.

18
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.300
And everything is measured in a management dashboard.

19
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.300
Portfolio,

20
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.300
expected recovery,

21
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.300
propensity and arrears,

22
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.300
at a glance.

23
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.460
With reports by agent and by month,

24
00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.460
filters

25
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.020
and one-click export to Excel.

26
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:54.980
And every outcome —payment, plan, promise or not reached—
with its dates,

27
00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:55.980
amounts and notes.

28
00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.580
It exports and syncs on its own to your ERP
or database, over API.

29
00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.140
MV Kobra AI.

30
00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.340
Smart collections that run themselves.

31
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:03.860
Try it today.
